    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Background</h2>The girl wakes up from the eerie dungeon, and she looks around in fear, unaware that she is about to experience an unforgettable adventure...... Go on an adventure with your buddies and find out the truth behind everything.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832170/extras/9b17c5a5ab12b493db13ef8a308254f7.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > gameplay</h2>The producers plan to design different gameplay in each chapter, and strive to bring players a fresh and continuous experience!<br>How to play in the first chapter:<br>As a mage, you'll fight alongside two &quot;Stupid teammates.&quot; Select the cast direction through ADW, enter the arrows up, down, left, right, and when the arrows match a certain spell sequence, the spell will be automatically released. Diverse enemies, rich spell combinations and entry choices, as well as boss haunts and special levels, bring players a rich and wonderful game experience.Dynamic music sound effects, retro pixel art is also full of highlights!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832170/extras/e4f5c1a2a003323e39dc366258b337f8.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832170/extras/fcbfba9f14aefe1e245c112c8ee6c849.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>How to play in the second  chapter:<br>Turn-based strategy gameplay, players can form a powerful squad, reasonably plan the use of dice and props, play strategies in a limited space, maximize the use of resources, and defeat powerful enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832170/extras/ca8bd314f046c1e8a3519e973f4d6001.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832170/extras/c054ac11e63e5d2334bad1f2ba04f64f.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > game duration</h2>Plot mode: 60min+  It's constantly being updated!<br>Challenge mode infinite<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Bug feedback and update suggestions</h2>Producer contact QQ: 1223736337",
