ps/2832170/extras/ca8bd314f046c1e8a3519e973f4d6001.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832170/extras/c054ac11e63e5d2334bad1f2ba04f64f.avif?t=1754136322\" width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > game duration</h2>Plot mode: 60min+  It's constantly being updated!<br>Challenge mode infinite<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Bug feedback and update suggestions</h2>Producer contact QQ: 1223736337",
